# Xiaomi Mi NoteBook Ultra / Pro / Max - FPC1022 Fingerprint Sensor & Power Button
# Grants proper device access permissions and tagging to local active sessions.
# Note: Hardware S0 wake is cleanly managed by systemd (fpc1022-wake.service) and system-sleep
# to avoid USB re-enumeration feedback loops.

SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="10a5", ATTR{idProduct}=="9200", MODE="0660", TAG+="uaccess"
